{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43482","headline":"嘉和合頴 · 无名氏","name":"嘉和合頴","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"天祚皇王德，神呈瑞谷嘉。\n感时苗特秀，证道叶方华。\n气转腾佳色，云披映早霞。\n薰风浮合頴，湛露净祥花。\n六穗垂兼倒，孤茎嫋复斜。\n影同唐叔献，称庆比周家。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"无名氏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43482.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43482","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}